      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Christiana sits in Pine Creek’s valley, where the stream eventually joins Octoraro Creek, a tributary of the Susquehanna River.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        27
